{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cet7dXh1sZMBC1b5tXVgP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Repository findings:**\n- `Shipment.kt:9` — Shipment model with status field\n- `ShipmentStatus:23` — enum with CREATED, CONFIRMED, CANCELLED states\n- `ShipmentController.kt:20-56` — has create, getById, list; no confirm yet\n- `ShipmentRepository.kt:11-27` — in-memory repository with save, findById, existsById, clear\n- `ApiExceptions.kt:18-24` — ResourceNotFoundException (404), ConflictException (409)\n- `ErrorCode:31-37` — enum with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND, SHIPMENT_ALREADY_EXISTS\n- `GlobalExceptionHandler.kt:14-29` — converts ApiException to ApiError responses\n- `ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — MockMvc tests asserting status and error envelope\n\n**Conventions found:**\n1. POST endpoints return `ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.CREATED).body(entity)`\n2. 404 errors: throw `ResourceNotFoundException(ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND, \"message\")`\n3. 409 errors: throw `ConflictException(ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_ALREADY_EXISTS, \"message\")`\n4. Tests check both status code and `$.error.code` in response body\n5. Kotlin + Spring Boot with MockMvc for integration tests\n6. One ErrorCode per distinct error case\n\n**Affected files:**\n1. `ApiError.kt` — Add ErrorCode enum value for CANCELLED rejection (unavoidable; used by exception)\n2. `ShipmentController.kt` — Add confirm endpoint method (unavoidable; this is the ticket)\n3. `ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — Add test cases for all four scenarios (unavoidable; verify acceptance criteria)\n\n**Risks:**\n- Missing ErrorCode enum value causes compilation failure\n- Wrong HTTP status or error structure breaks error contract and existing clients\n- Breaking existing tests regresses the fixture\n- Touching unrelated files fails scope check\n\n**Open questions:** None — the ticket fully specifies all four cases.\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:DESIGN>>\n\n**Proposed changes, file by file:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** — Add `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED` to the ErrorCode enum. This code signals that a shipment in CANCELLED state cannot transition to any other state. Enum should be added in alphabetical order with other SHIPMENT codes.\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** — Add a `confirm` method annotated with `@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")` that:\n   - Accepts the shipment ID from path variable\n   - Retrieves the shipment (throw `ResourceNotFoundException` with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND if not found)\n   - If status is CANCELLED, throw `ConflictException` with SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED and HTTP 409\n   - If status is CREATED, update to CONFIRMED, save, and return the saved shipment\n   - If status is CONFIRMED (idempotent case), return the shipment unchanged\n   - Return `ResponseEntity.ok(shipment)` to match GET conventions\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Add four new test methods:\n   - Test confirming a CREATED shipment transitions to CONFIRMED and returns 200\n   - Test confirming an already CONFIRMED shipment returns 200 and status remains CONFIRMED (idempotent)\n   - Test confirming a CANCELLED shipment returns 409 with error envelope\n   - Test confirming a non-existent shipment returns 404 with error envelope\n\n**Alternative rejected:**\nI considered adding a `ConfirmShipmentRequest` DTO for the request body, but the ticket specifies no request body, only the path parameter, so an empty POST with no body is correct.\n\n**Data and error flow:**\n\n| Case | Input | Read | Write | Output | Mechanism |\n|------|-------|------|-------|--------|-----------|\n| CREATED → CONFIRMED | POST /shipments/S-1/confirm | findById(S-1) returns Shipment(status=CREATED) | save(Shipment(status=CONFIRMED)) | 200 OK + confirmed shipment | ResponseEntity.ok() |\n| Retry CONFIRMED | POST /shipments/S-1/confirm | findById(S-1) returns Shipment(status=CONFIRMED) | None (no change) | 200 OK + same shipment | ResponseEntity.ok() |\n| CANCELLED rejected | POST /shipments/S-1/confirm | findById(S-1) returns Shipment(status=CANCELLED) | None | 409 Conflict + error envelope | ConflictException caught by GlobalExceptionHandler |\n| Not found | POST /shipments/missing/confirm | findById(missing) returns null | None | 404 Not Found + error envelope | ResourceNotFoundException caught by GlobalExceptionHandler |\n\n**Test strategy:**\n- Test 1: Create S-1, confirm it, assert 200 OK and status=\"CONFIRMED\" ✓ confirms idempotency criterion\n- Test 2: Create S-2, confirm it, confirm it again, assert 200 OK both times and status=\"CONFIRMED\" ✓ confirms retry succeeds\n- Test 3: Manually insert a CANCELLED shipment, post confirm, assert 409 Conflict with SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED ✓ confirms cancelled rejection\n- Test 4: Post confirm to unknown ID, assert 404 Not Found with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND ✓ confirms unknown id rejection\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:IMPLEMENTATION>>\n\nNow I'll write the code, starting with adding the ErrorCode:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1366,"cache_read_input_tokens":18221,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1366},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"33d7f1a2-0f0c-4aac-8f8a-fb5a1e8bcfa6","uuid":"16c7f422-cf3e-43f1-822a-aa1cd2b2f82f","timestamp":"2026-09-09T15:38:31.891Z","request_id":"req_011Cet7dX34mvbdtHYALnenz"}
